@DOLL. Better than I was- hem.

@HOSTESS. Why, that's well said; a good heart's worth gold.
Lo, here comes Sir John.

[Enter FALSTAFF]

@FALSTAFF. {Singing} 'When Arthur first in court'- Empty the
